### Demo 3: short-term memory, then long-term memory
@host = http://localhost:8099

######## Memory demo, step 1: short-term memory ########
# One conversation. The advisor replays its recent messages on every call.

### S1. Tell it your name
POST {{host}}/api/memory/conversations/s1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hi, my name is Maria. Answer in one short sentence."
}

### S2. Ask for it back. It remembers, because the advisor replays S1.
POST {{host}}/api/memory/conversations/s1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What's my name?"
}

### S3. Look inside the repository: 4 messages (2 user, 2 assistant)
GET {{host}}/api/memory/conversations/s1

### S4. A new conversation ID starts empty. It has no idea.
POST {{host}}/api/memory/conversations/s2/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What's my name?"
}

### S5. Restart the app, then look again: empty. InMemoryChatMemoryRepository is a Map in the JVM.
GET {{host}}/api/memory/conversations/s1

######## Memory demo, step 2: long-term memory ########
# Start clean: rm -rf memories. Long-term memory is files on disk, so a restart keeps it.
# Keep the memories/ folder open in the IDE. The files appear on L1.

### L1. Conversation 1: Maria tells us about her trip. Watch memories/C-100/ appear
POST {{host}}/api/memory/customers/C-100/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "trip",
  "message": "I'm traveling to Portugal next week. Please text me about anything, don't email."
}

### L2. Conversation 2, new conversation ID: the model reads her files and recalls Portugal and texting
POST {{host}}/api/memory/customers/C-100/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "card",
  "message": "Will my card work on my trip?"
}

### L3. Another customer, same question: James's tools only reach memories/C-200/
POST {{host}}/api/memory/customers/C-200/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "card",
  "message": "Will my card work on my trip?"
}

### L4. Forget Maria: her folder and her conversations are deleted
DELETE {{host}}/api/memory/customers/C-100

### L5. Ask again in conversation 2: nothing is recalled
POST {{host}}/api/memory/customers/C-100/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "card",
  "message": "Will my card work on my trip?"
}
